+ * Loads a browser-only view before its route renders; the route's `loader` awaits it. React holds
+ * the reveal of a Suspense boundary that resolves after showing its fallback until 300 ms after the
+ * last fallback it showed, so a page whose view suspended on first entry sat on its skeleton long
